To perform calculation 2354 plus 3485 we set up then calculate.

4
00:00:48,930 --> 00:01:01,510
Step 1: Set up, when setting up note that digits in the same place are aligned in columns.

5
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:12,710
Step 2: Perform addition from right to left.

6
00:01:12,710 --> 00:01:22,570
4 plus 5 equals 9 write 9

7
00:01:23,240 --> 00:01:36,280
5 plus 8 equals 13 write 3 carry 1

8
00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:51,060
3 plus 4 equals 7 plus 1 equals 8 write 8

9
00:01:51,510 --> 00:02:02,370
2 plus 3 equals 5 write 5

10
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:22,680
So 2354 plus 3485 equals 5839.

11
