Perform calculation 4527 plus 2738.

12
00:02:36,200 --> 00:02:54,400
To perform calculation 4527 plus 2738 we set up then calculate.

13
00:02:54,400 --> 00:03:00,930
To calculate we need to note.

14
00:03:00,930 --> 00:03:11,200
Set up each addend aligned in columns.

15
00:03:11,460 --> 00:03:18,060
Perform addition from right to left.

16
00:03:18,060 --> 00:03:30,020
7 plus 8 equals 15, write 5 carry 1

17
00:03:30,570 --> 00:03:43,310
2 plus 3 equals 5 plus 1 is 6, write 6

18
00:03:43,640 --> 00:03:54,130
5 plus 7 equals 12, write 2 carry 1

19
